---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${siteConfig.name}. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information when you play our lip-reading party game.`}
  path="/privacy"
>

  <article class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {siteConfig.lastUpdated}</p>
      <div class="legal-content">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how {siteConfig.legalEntity} (“we”, “us”, or “our”)
          handles information when you use the {siteConfig.name} mobile application and this website
          (together, the “Service”).
        </p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          {siteConfig.name} is a two-player lip-reading party game available on iOS and Android.
          For privacy questions, contact us at
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>Depending on how you play, we may process:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Gameplay data:</strong> scores, match history, selected decks, and settings stored
            on your device.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Online room data:</strong> room codes, join/leave events, and match state needed to
            run multiplayer sessions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Audio and camera (online mode):</strong> when you start an online match, the app
            may access your microphone and camera so players can lip-read over live video. Voice audio
            from the reader is not intended to be delivered to the guesser as audible speech for the
            challenge. Streams are processed to provide the live session and are not stored by us as
            lasting video libraries.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Optional recordings:</strong> if you choose to save a screen recording, media may
            be written to your device photo library with your permission.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Purchases:</strong> subscription and in-app purchase status are handled by Apple
            App Store / Google Play and our payment partner (RevenueCat). We receive entitlement
            status, not your full payment card details.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Diagnostics and analytics:</strong> crash reports, performance metrics, and
            aggregated usage events (for example via Firebase Analytics, Crashlytics, and Remote
            Config) to keep the app stable and improve features.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Push notifications:</strong> a device push token if you allow notifications.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Support messages:</strong> whatever you send when you email support.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Operate local and online gameplay</li>
          <li>Sync rooms and live video sessions</li>
          <li>Provide subscriptions, free quotas, and restore purchases</li>
          <li>Measure reliability, fix bugs, and tune features</li>
          <li>Respond to support requests</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Legal bases (EEA/UK)</h2>
        <p>
          Where applicable, we process personal data to perform the Service you request, based on
          our legitimate interests in running a secure and enjoyable game, and/or with your consent
          (for example camera, microphone, notifications, or photo library permissions).
        </p>

        <h2>5. Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Infrastructure and backend providers used to run rooms and accounts</li>
          <li>Live video providers used for online matches</li>
          <li>Analytics, crash reporting, and remote configuration vendors</li>
          <li>In-app purchase / subscription processors</li>
          <li>Authorities when required by law</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Other players in an online room may see your display presence and camera feed for the
          duration of the match.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Device-local data stays on your phone until you clear app data or uninstall. Online session
          data is kept only as long as needed to operate rooms and improve the Service. Support emails
          are retained as needed to resolve your request.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use industry-standard safeguards appropriate to a consumer mobile game. No method of
          transmission or storage is 100% secure.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Children</h2>
        <p>
          The Service is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children under 13
          (or the equivalent minimum age in your country). If you believe a child provided personal
          information, contact us and we will take appropriate steps.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Your choices and rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Revoke camera, microphone, photos, or notification permissions in system settings</li>
          <li>Disable analytics where the OS or app settings allow</li>
          <li>Request access, correction, or deletion by emailing support</li>
          <li>Manage or cancel subscriptions in your Apple ID or Google Play account settings</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you may have additional rights under GDPR, UK GDPR, CCPA/CPRA,
          or similar laws.
        </p>

        <h2>10. International transfers</h2>
        <p>
          We and our processors may process data in countries other than your own. Where required, we
          rely on appropriate transfer safeguards.
        </p>

        <h2>11. This website</h2>
        <p>
          Our marketing site at {siteConfig.url} collects standard server/logs data necessary to
          deliver pages and may use privacy-friendly hosting analytics. It does not require an account.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date above will change when
          we do. Continued use of the Service after an update means you accept the revised policy.
        </p>

        <h2>13. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.supportEmail}`}>{siteConfig.supportEmail}</a><br />
          App: {siteConfig.name} ({siteConfig.bundleId})
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
